	(paper "A4")
	(title_block
		(title "MP62 port module MOD-A: 1 x USB-A 3.2 Gen2 (Hong Cheng HC-USB3.0-L137-WJ) on FPC - fit x4")
		(date "2026-10-02")
		(rev "A1")
		(company "MP62 I/O - port modules (D-IO16)")
		(comment 1 "JLC FPC 2-layer 0.11 mm (PI 25 um core, Cu 12/12 um), ENIG, coverlay PI 12.5 + 15 adh.. Stiffeners: FR4 1.0 (B) under the port, FR4 0.6 (B) under the paddle")
		(comment 2 "L1 signals: 90 ohm USB / 100 ohm TMDS diff microstrip (2D FD solve, tools/zsolve.py; TDR coupon), L2 GND (hatched 45 deg in the bend and the whole tail)")
		(comment 3 "Fold: flat as drawn; 180 deg at Bend_Zone so J2 faces DOWN onto the main-board JMn. Pinout = PMI-50 v2 (pmi50.py, plan 4.7.10)")
	)
